    "props": {
      "cost": "30 MP",
      "damage_bonus": "20 + (EQUIPPED_SHIELD_COUNT >= 2) * 10 + (CHAR_LEVEL >= 30) * 10",
      "description": "<p>As long as your personal vehicle has a steed frame, it may have up to 2 active weapon modules (instead of 1).</p><p>During a conflict, if you have a <strong>martial armor</strong> or <strong>martial armor module</strong> equipped, you may use an action and spend <strong>30 Mind Points</strong> to choose earth or physical. If you do, you deal <strong>20 damage</strong> of the chosen type to every enemy you can see, and enemies that lose Hit Points this way cannot perform <strong>free attacks</strong> until the start of their next turn.</p><p>This effect deals <strong>+10 damage</strong> if you are driving a personal vehicle with a mech frame and/or have <strong>two shields equipped</strong>, and also deals <strong>+10 damage</strong> if you are <strong>level 30 or higher</strong>.</p>",
